    "detailed_description": "The player will play the role of Nia, who accidentally enters Alice's past memories on the train to her best friend Alice's graduation ceremony. The only way to escape the illusion and return to the real world is to help Alice solve all the problems she is currently facing.<br><br><strong>Examine every clue around you to understand the current story and dilemma that Alice is facing. </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2382660/extras/bf85397f4c40b7ae637d2bd737ed51a5.avif?t=1705270604\" /></span><br><br><strong>Collect clues and solve puzzles to help Alice solve her troubles or fulfill her current wishes.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2382660/extras/10f893269667ae09bb1606cb17a924c8.avif?t=1705270604\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2382660/extras/7533052cbc9921424a28ed5be9e6f4d6.avif?t=1705270604\" /></span><br><br><strong>Experience the journey and learn about what happened to Alice.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2382660/extras/446a3d4681b3e3961d1653171bff9fbe.avif?t=1705270604\" /></span><br><br>During this process, Nia gradually learned about everything Alice had gone through. If she could go back to the past and start all over again, would there still be any regrets left?<br><br><i>The Flying Feathers</i> is a first-person narrative game, which combines interactive experience and cutscenes to immerse players in the story.",
    "about_the_game": "The player will play the role of Nia, who accidentally enters Alice's past memories on the train to her best friend Alice's graduation ceremony. The only way to escape the illusion and return to the real world is to help Alice solve all the problems she is currently facing.<br><br><strong>Examine every clue around you to understand the current story and dilemma that Alice is facing. </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2382660/extras/bf85397f4c40b7ae637d2bd737ed51a5.avif?t=1705270604\" /></span><br><br><strong>Collect clues and solve puzzles to help Alice solve her troubles or fulfill her current wishes.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2382660/extras/10f893269667ae09bb1606cb17a924c8.avif?t=1705270604\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2382660/extras/7533052cbc9921424a28ed5be9e6f4d6.avif?t=1705270604\" /></span><br><br><strong>Experience the journey and learn about what happened to Alice.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2382660/extras/446a3d4681b3e3961d1653171bff9fbe.avif?t=1705270604\" /></span><br><br>During this process, Nia gradually learned about everything Alice had gone through. If she could go back to the past and start all over again, would there still be any regrets left?<br><br><i>The Flying Feathers</i> is a first-person narrative game, which combines interactive experience and cutscenes to immerse players in the story.",
